  "new_claims": [
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "石头越来越沉默，忽然有一天他开始疯狂地游玩，山林间满是他的声音。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "石头越来越沉默了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "一个狂欢的夜里，一只老猴默默离开人群，往山深处走去；石头坐在黑暗中问他去哪儿。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一只老猴默默地离开人群"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "老猴自称“我去我该去的地方”，并说每个生灵都会去那个地方，那里很安静、适合他这样的老家伙，说石头年轻，应在月光下狂呼高叫。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我去我该去的地方"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-4",
      "text": "石头说“声音最终是要消散的”；老猴说不会停，并引特写林间石台上猴子们的欢叫连成一片。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "可声音最终是要消散的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-5",
      "text": "老猴对石头说“你是从石头中蹦出来的吧”，说他总是忧虑，因为几万年的沉寂使他还害怕林间的跳跃与扑面而来的事物；并说石头能自由思考的时间极短，要他珍惜生命中所出现的一切。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "你是从石头中蹦出来的吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-6",
      "text": "老猴说传说山外的大海中有不死的神龙，但它们大多数时间孤独地沉在海底；并说纵然能留住自己，也留不住身边的东西，只剩自己的沉重没有人能承受。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "传说山外的大海中有不死的神龙"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-7",
      "text": "石头说“我会变得很强，强到可以承受一切”；老猴反问是否真有那样顽强的生命，说那样的人也会被越来越沉重的自己所压倒，随后承认自己搞不清这些道理。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我会变得很强，强到可以承受一切"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-8",
      "text": "老猴把一个椰壶递给石头，说“这是‘得到’，它是果实消失形体后变成的东西”，说它能让人忘记自己、与世界合成一体，喝下会觉得自已就是这森林、这月亮、这河。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "candidate_name": "老猴"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "它是果实消失形体后变成的东西"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-9",
      "text": "石头喝下椰壶中之物后站起高兴地笑；老猴问“你是谁”，石头答“我就是天，我就是所有！我最大！”，随后伸臂狂啸，攀上石台加入猴群的狂舞；老猴对他说“你不就是已得到了一切么”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我就是天，我就是所有！我最大！"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-10",
      "text": "秋更深了，翔鸟一家要启程离开。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "翔鸟一家要启程了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-11",
      "text": "松鼠对阿笨说“小笨不要走，我会难过的”；阿笨说“我明年还会回来的”。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0139/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0139"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "小笨不要走，我会难过的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-12",
      "text": "阿笨说翔鸟要追着太阳飞、不能离它太远，注定一生花在奔波上，真正能停下来生活的日子只有一会儿；说自己路上会一直想着，为相聚的时光尽力飞翔。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0139/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0139"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我们要追着太阳"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-13",
      "text": "阿笨说迁徙路上有许多鸟不能到达，那不会是他，但父母飞不动时会掉进大海；没有翔鸟死在窝里，他们在大洋上空飞越，直到最后投入大洋。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0139/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0139"
      },
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "没有翔鸟是死在窝里的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-14",
      "text": "阿笨握住松鼠的手，说自己懂得这些是从知道会长大那天起，并说“我们都 会 长大的”，说漫长旅途会让他们衰老，但会不后悔地奔向生命中最绚丽的年华。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000054",
          "chapter_order": 54,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "从我知道我会长大的那一天起吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-15",
      "text": "松鼠挠了挠头，似乎没听懂阿笨的话，原文叙述她“觉得难过而又盼望着”。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-002/ch-000054.txt",
